---
import Legal from "../layouts/Legal.astro";
---

<Legal title="Refund Policy" updated="2026-06-22">
  <p>
    We want you to be happy with Vidova. This policy explains when
    refunds apply to subscriptions and credit packs.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Subscriptions</h2>
  <p>
    If a renewal charge was unexpected, contact us within 7 days for a full
    refund of that period, provided usage in the period was minimal (under 10%
    of the included credits). You can cancel any time to stop future renewals;
    access continues until the end of the paid period.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Credit packs</h2>
  <p>
    Unused credit packs can be refunded within 7 days of purchase. Once credits
    have been spent on AI generation, the spent portion is non-refundable because
    a third-party cost was incurred on your behalf.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Failed or duplicate payments</h2>
  <p>
    Duplicate transfers or payments that did not credit your account are refunded
    in full once verified against our payment records. Our webhook is idempotent,
    so accidental double transfers are detected.
  </p>

  <h2>4. How to request</h2>
  <p>
    Contact support through the app with your order code (shown at checkout and
    on your invoice). Refunds are returned to the originating bank account,
    typically within 5–7 business days.
  </p>
</Legal>
